{"id":"8f37c0c5a80ad42fecf319a1b50c3e2314f2fdd6","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1236638","title":"codex 的 pro20x 都不够一个系统修复用的","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"hefmt137","excerpt":"OpenAI - @hefmt137 - 开了 ultra➕极速，接近 100 个 subagent 同时处理，根本不够登，不敢这么玩了","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Main\">\n                \n                \n<div><p>开了 ultra➕极速，接近 100 个 subagent 同时处理，根本不够登，不敢这么玩了</p></div>\n\n<!-- SOL tip topic -->\n\n\n\n\n\n<div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18008266\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/f6e1/4cff/103705_normal.png?m=1749225291\" alt=\"ByteRan\" data-uid=\"103705\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/ByteRan\">ByteRan</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-24 00:12:39 +08:00\">20h 32m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>夺少？ 100 个 subagent ？</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18008296\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/4676b54daa0f44b885474248e64b6972?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"ntdll\" data-uid=\"148771\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/ntdll\">ntdll</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-24 00:48:53 +08:00\">19h 56m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>不太能理解，这就和抖音上的段子一样。</p><p>一个 App ，一个人开发要 10 天，10 个人一起开发，就只要 1 天嘛。</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18008299\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/810b/a1c3/518305_normal.png?m=1758018402\" alt=\"northluo\" data-uid=\"518305\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/northluo\">northluo</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-24 00:54:03 +08:00\">19h 51m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 1</span>\n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/ntdll\">ntdll</a> 是一个女人生一个孩子要 10 个月，但是领导觉得给你 10 个女人，一个月就能生出来一个孩子～～～</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18008336\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/c8a2/3f84/173108_normal.png?m=1769246969\" alt=\"SingeeKing\" data-uid=\"173108\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>6</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/SingeeKing\">SingeeKing</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>PRO</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-24 03:43:12 +08:00\">17h 2m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>100 个。。。Sub Agent 不是银弹，这么多很可能变成一个各种冲突 + 浪费 Token 的现场，Codex 默认限制只有 3 个 Sub Agent 还是有一定道理的</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18008353\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/7ff2414e3d1936042bd28d3815b55b2f?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"night98\" data-uid=\"279313\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>7</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/night98\">night98</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-24 06:37:42 +08:00\">14h 7m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>没啥意义，核心还是得不降智，降智了你这么玩除了额度在燃烧没啥意义，我感觉 codex 压根没对 ultra 做优化，只看见额度按照两分钟 1%往下掉，进度拉的一批</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18008455\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/d1f6edc591d0494de75467adc42aa4f5?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"miniliuke\" data-uid=\"243929\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/miniliuke\">miniliuke</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-24 08:41:16 +08:00\">12h 4m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>这种简单任务开 100 个子 agent 不就变成了 0.2 倍 plus......0.2 倍 plus 是不够 ultra➕极速一个问题的</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18008468\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/6ed4ee4dd2e384a9d8d47d2e7f43c5c4?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"maolon\" data-uid=\"442547\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>9</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/maolon\">maolon</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-24 08:44:48 +08:00\">12h 0m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>100 个子 agent ，以 codex 的 harenss 来讲就是浪费 token ，因为大部分的工作都是互相踩踏。</p><p>也别说我张口就来，5.6 sol 刚出的时候我就试过 ultra + 500 个子 agent 了，大部分的工作都是无用功</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18008539\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/7460/e1cd/274090_normal.png?m=1765551963\" alt=\"Danswerme\" data-uid=\"274090\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>10</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Danswerme\">Danswerme</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-24 09:03:53 +08:00\">11h 41m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>100 个人 1 个月能盖好一栋房子，10000000000000000000000000000 个人 1 秒就可以盖完。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18008599\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/83d2553e6fa77b01b5f7c72009dfae71?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"HENQIGUAI\" data-uid=\"195766\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>11</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/HENQIGUAI\">HENQIGUAI</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-24 09:13:56 +08:00\">11h 31m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>100 个 subagent ，这肯定是 bug 了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18008817\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/382f/1f51/414567_normal.png?m=1691026308\" alt=\"cheng6563\" data-uid=\"414567\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>12</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/cheng6563\">cheng6563</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-24 09:42:10 +08:00\">11h 3m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>sol 的怪癖，subagent 套 subagent 运行。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18009254\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/127c01c2f36cd4ce3ca9afc2502f9198?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"prosgtsr\" data-uid=\"649369\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>14</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/prosgtsr\">prosgtsr</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-24 10:34:20 +08:00\">10h 11m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>100 个 subagent 同时处理，这给你多少 token 都不够用啊</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18009385\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/3f966a41c3a42993730e4b50a1f6fefb?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"NasirQ\" data-uid=\"305609\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>15</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/NasirQ\">NasirQ</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-24 10:46:33 +08:00\">9h 59m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>........ 100 个 sub ，如果你在开始前没有做好限制，大概率 token 都在“内耗”。</p><p>sub01:我修改创建了 xxx<br>sub99:发现有未跟踪的文件，清理工作区...</p><p>sub01:创建的 xxx 消失了，再次创建<br>sub99:发现有未跟踪的文件，清理工作区...</p><p>sub01:创建的 xxx 再次消失了，怀疑是被别的程序覆盖，增加规则...</p><p>然后你的 token 就少了 10%</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18009793\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/e79b187e76b321a733265197a7e45360?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"hefmt137\" data-uid=\"412721\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>17</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/hefmt137\">hefmt137</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-24 11:29:21 +08:00\">9h 16m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/NasirQ\">NasirQ</a> 确实如此，跑了一晚上第一个任务还在跑，20x 额度已经用完了，今天刚好重置</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18010057\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/ffca59c5ffc890b3fd7065b5f93bf4ae?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"deplives\" data-uid=\"456093\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>18</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/deplives\">deplives</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-24 12:00:47 +08:00\">8h 44m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>个人觉得 12 个以上的 sugagent 的除了废 token 毫无意义</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18010311\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/2587/5b7c/48601_normal.png?m=1698310191\" alt=\"coinpro\" data-uid=\"48601\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>19</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/coinpro\">coinpro</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-24 13:22:06 +08:00\">7h 23m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>感觉 sol 有毛病 总是过度</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18010395\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/de30/859d/190701_normal.png?m=1749289695\" alt=\"shakaraka\" data-uid=\"190701\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>21</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/shakaraka\">shakaraka</a></st